\pard\b\fs20 Battle Isles (Cannon Tower Expansion)\b0\par
\fs16\par
The rocket depends heavily on the wind and has low accuracy.\par
Fuel the rocket with oil in the cannon tower. The rocket can hold at most 1 barrel of fuel.\par
The fuel load, and with it the range, can be set with 'dig' at the dismantled rocket.\par
Enemy rockets can be shot down with the anti-aircraft gun.\par
Each team starts with a well-developed settlement. The first player receives a flag and chooses the first base building. In it, the next player can then buy another flag, and so on...\par
Empty barrels sell for the price of oil barrels, fuel and rockets are resupplied quickly, and an automatic money supply keeps the war chest well filled.\par
